    "final_answer": "Based on my search on Amazon, I successfully applied the filters:\n- **4 Stars & Up** rating filter ✓\n- **Stainless Steel** material filter ✓\n- Capacity requirement: at least 1.5 liters\n\nHere are the top electric kettles that meet **all three criteria** (1.5L+ capacity, stainless steel material, 4+ star rating):\n\n## 🏆 Top Matching Results:\n\n| # | Product | Capacity | Rating | Price |\n|---|---------|----------|--------|-------|\n| 1 | **Cosori Electric Kettle** (No Plastic Contact with Water) | 1.7L | ⭐ 4.5 (49,505 reviews) | $25.99 |\n| 2 | **COMFEE' Stainless Steel Electric Kettle** (1500W Fast Boil) | 1.7L | ⭐ 4.6 (16,694 reviews) | $24.28 |\n| 3 | **Chefman Electric Kettle** (Stainless Steel Filter, BPA Free) | 1.8L | ⭐ 4.5 (13,974 reviews) | $23.52 |\n| 4 | **Cuisinart Electric Kettle** (CPK-17P1, 6 Temp Presets) | 1.7L | ⭐ 4.4 (19,347 reviews) | $92.00 |\n\n## 🌟 Best Pick Recommendation:\n\nThe **COMFEE' Stainless Steel Electric Kettle (1.7L)** stands out as the top choice:\n- ✅ **Highest rating**: 4.6 stars with 16,694 reviews\n- ✅ **Stainless steel** construction\n- ✅ **1.7L capacity** (exceeds the 1.5L minimum)\n- ✅ Most affordable at **$24.28**\n\n**Runner-up**: The **Cosori Electric Kettle (1.7L)** is also excellent with the highest number of reviews (49.5K) and a great 4.5-star rating at $25.99, making it the most trusted option by customer count.",
